[00:00.000]作曲 : DALCEXY DAN
[00:01.000]编曲 : DALCEXY DAN
[00:14.229]We've been through all varieties of winds
[00:18.370]我们曾穿越万千风雨
[00:18.370]Blown against scales and rainstorms
[00:22.338]直面狂风与暴雨的侵袭
[00:22.338]Gave more scars on broken wings
[00:26.610]为残破羽翼添更多伤痕
[00:26.610]Past the shadows we strove to soar
[00:30.794]穿越阴影我们奋力翱翔
[00:30.794]To wipe the dark I've endeavored
[00:35.266]为驱散黑暗我竭力尝试
[00:35.266]And I seem to find only a little dirt
[00:39.026]却只寻得些许希望的痕迹
[00:39.026]I wish that hope could be heard
[00:44.642]多希望希望能被倾听
[00:44.642]But why should we be touched by the squall
[00:45.978]可为何我们总被风暴惊扰
[00:45.978]Dashing out into the sunshine early forth
[00:53.547]尽早奔向那片阳光闪耀
[00:53.547]And always be with you
[01:05.823]永远与你相伴
[01:05.823]I'll revive the most fresh and gentle breeze
[01:11.850]我会唤醒最清新温柔的风
[01:11.850]I'll bring it back for you
[01:14.223]为你将它带回身边
[01:14.223]We'll make it true
[01:22.463]我们定能实现
[01:22.463]We shall make it side by side
[01:27.849]并肩共赴此愿
[01:27.849]I'll take wing to dispel the myst and fly back into you
[01:30.975]我会振翅驱散迷雾飞回你身边
[01:30.975]Like I always do
[01:39.258]如我往昔不变
[01:39.258]Thought I'd be gone with the wind
[01:58.775]原以为我会随风而逝
[01:58.775]Still I chose to lift up the sky
[02:02.783]却仍选择撑起这片苍穹
[02:02.783]Even just a little piece
[02:06.736]哪怕仅能托起一角
[02:06.736]Pierced the blizzard to free the light
[02:11.023]穿透暴雪释放光芒
[02:11.023]Oh now I am stronger enough to keep on holding
[02:15.143]此刻我已足够坚强继续守望
[02:15.143]I should let hope be heard by all
[02:19.752]我要让希望被众人听见
[02:19.752]I'll be the messenger
[02:23.503]我愿做那传递者
[02:23.503]Always be with you
[02:28.007]永远与你相伴
[02:28.007]I'll revive the most fresh and gentle breeze
[02:31.695]我会唤醒最清新温柔的风
[02:31.695]I'll bring it back for you
[02:38.911]为你将它带回身边
[02:38.911]We'll make it true
[02:41.496]我们定能实现
[02:41.496]Oh make it side by side
[02:47.991]并肩共赴此愿
[02:47.991]I'll take wing to dispel the mist and fly back into you
[02:53.127]我会振翅驱散迷雾飞回你身边
[02:53.127]Oh yes I do
[02:56.503]如我往昔不变
[02:56.503]Always be with you
[03:04.826]永远与你相伴
[03:04.826]I'll revive the most fresh and gentle breeze
[03:28.007]我会唤醒最清新温柔的风
[03:28.007]I'll bring it back for you
[03:36.007]为你将它带回身边
[03:36.007]We'll make it true
[03:44.744]我们定能实现
[03:44.744]Oh we should make it side by side
[03:49.463]并肩共赴此愿
[03:49.463]I'll take wing to dispel the mystify
